cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "liftmath"
abstract: >-
  Evidence-based strength training math: 1RM estimation, percentage-based
  load charts, weekly volume landmarks per muscle group, mesocycle ramps,
  macro targets, plate loading, warm-up ramps, and Wilks/DOTS/IPF GL
  relative-strength scoring. Pure Python standard library, no runtime
  dependencies.
authors:
